downloaded_files/
# feed-in assets are INPUTS, not artifacts (the integration suite's
# deterministic inputs ride the repo — GPU output may vary, feeds
# may not). **/ matches any future depth — a subdir like
# tests/integration/assets/scene1/feed.png stays tracked.
!tests/integration/assets/**/*.png
# the scail2 driving video (cluster E): 143 KB, 512x320x25f —
# deterministic POSE input, committed like the png feeds
!tests/integration/assets/**/drive_pose.mp4

