# === Secrets / credentials ===
# Root config — required on every install, contains machine-specific
# paths (model storage roots, engine URLs). Created by the user (or
# by the provisioner's bootstrap on a fresh checkout); NEVER commit —
# `py/estate_config.py` is its ONE parser and tests/walls/suites/test_estate_config.py
# asserts the file is present on disk.
inference.config.json
.env
.env.*

